chapter.v:
	Therefore, brethren, 

	 seek out from among you seven men of good reputation, full of the Holy Spirit and wisdom, whom we may appoint over this business;
 [Gen. 12:1]

	They also 

	 set up false witnesses who said, “This man does not cease to speak blasphemous words against this holy place and the law;
 [Gen. 45:4,]
